<title>SPAIN: Uralita to pay 10 ptas gross interim div.</title>
<headline>Uralita to pay 10 ptas gross interim div.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish building materials firm Uralita SA said on Friday it will pay an interim dividend of 10 pesetas gross against 1996 results.</p>
<p>The payment will be made on December 4.</p>
<p>Uralita posted a net attributable profit of 1.93 billion pesetas in the nine months to September.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
